# Unlocking a Myth: Warrior (jeuno 102): upsetting Zalsuhm. A level 75 Warrior wearing the Sturdy Axe: 10086 (1),
# finished 53: Upset_Zalsuhm 1, the zoning flag set. Both: 10090. Upset_Zalsuhm 0 by a GM, the flag still set: 10086
# (the flag alone does nothing). Upset_Zalsuhm 1 again (a GM), a rezone (the flag cleared): upset without the flag:
# Upset_Zalsuhm reset to 0, then 10086 (1); finished 1: begun.
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10086
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
item SturdyAxe wsp=0
login
equip SturdyAxe Main                    # the Main slot
trigger Zalsuhm                         # wearing it: 10086 (1)
finish option=53                        # Upset_Zalsuhm 1; the zoning flag
trigger Zalsuhm                         # the flag and upset: 10090
finish
charvar Quest[3][102]Upset_Zalsuhm 0    # a GM
trigger Zalsuhm                         # the flag, not upset: 10086 (1)
finish
charvar Quest[3][102]Upset_Zalsuhm 1    # a GM
rezone                                  # the zoning flag cleared
trigger Zalsuhm                         # upset, no flag: Upset_Zalsuhm 0; wearing it: 10086 (1)
finish option=1                         # begun
